1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:03,360
Just because the Police let you out
doesn't mean you didn't kill anyone.

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:07,120
They'll soon find evidence
to prove you're the killer.

3
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:10,400
If you piss me off, I'll kill you as well.

4
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:38,640
At the scene in Wan Mei Village

5
00:00:38,720 --> 00:00:41,520
the clothing fiber we found
on the sugarcane,

6
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:43,520
the suspected murder weapon,

7
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:45,440
matched the jacket we found in your room.

8
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:48,960
Your helper Law Suet-chau
and Leung Yuet-ping both confirmed

9
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:52,240
the night you identified the body,
you were wearing that jacket.

10
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,480
We asked Tang Heung-nam,

11
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:58,040
he confirmed on October 15,
the night Cheung Siu-chung died,

12
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,600
he saw you bought sugarcane,

13
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:01,480
he drove you to Wan Mei Village

14
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:04,680
and drove you home after 11p.m., right?

15
00:01:05,240 --> 00:01:07,120
Cheung Wang-chi also confirmed

16
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:10,560
you threw away Cheung Siu-chung's
smart watch,

17
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:15,840
which recorded his time of death
was at 12:05a.m.

18
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:18,560
Which means, he was already 21 years old

19
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:21,320
and was entitled to inherit
Cheung Kin-kwok's estate.

20
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:24,320
Because you were left out of the will,

21
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,680
you threw away the watch,

22
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:27,160
so nobody would know, is that right?

23
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:30,240
That night you went to see
Cheung Siu-chung at Wan Mei Village,

24
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,440
what exactly did you do?

25
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:38,640
That night...I wanted to stop Chung
from giving away Kin-kwok's assets.

26
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:40,960
But when I arrived,

27
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:43,040
I found out he already
made the arrangements.

28
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:47,840
I set up a trust fund,
Mom will get the house...

29
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:51,600
What? The tramp gets the house?

30
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:54,800
No, Grandma! Only on the condition

31
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:58,720
you and Dad have both passed away,

32
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:02,640
before it can be rented or sold.

33
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:06,240
I don't care. She can't have the house.

34
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:08,400
He just wouldn't listen.

35
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:10,640
I started scolding him and he kept
stepping back,

36
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:14,080
until he ran into the cabinet

37
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:16,320
and he hit his head.

38
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:17,920
You were so angry at the time,

39
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:19,920
did you kill him?

40
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:22,080
No! I did not.

41
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:26,480
He already got up when I left.

42
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:28,160
Did you give him sugarcane?

43
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:32,000
No, he ate it himself.

44
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:36,560
It was after 11p.m. when Nam drove me home.

45
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:40,240
If you said his watched stopped at 12:05,

46
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:42,400
I had nothing to do with his death.

47
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:44,880
Why didn't you tell us you were
at the village house?

48
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:48,720
I bought him sugarcane.

49
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,560
I didn't want you to suspect me.

50
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:53,680
So I said nothing.

51
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,280
I checked...

52
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:58,560
Cheung Siu-chung's smart watch is
an analog model

53
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:01,760
that can be linked to the watch company's
cloud storage.

54
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:05,040
The user's health information

55
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,200
such as heartbeat and blood pressure

56
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:08,840
can be recorded in cloud storage.

57
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:12,000
It can be used individually without
connecting to the mobile phone.

58
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:15,280
Though the watch stopped at 12:05a.m.,

59
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:18,000
the medical examiner estimated
the time of death to be

60
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:23,200
between 11p.m. on October 15 and
1a.m. on October 16.

61
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:27,400
Which means even if Tang Suk-han
left after 11p.m.,

62
00:03:27,480 --> 00:03:29,400
she still could have killed
Cheung Siu-chung.

63
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:31,840
Check with the smart watch company,

64
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:34,240
to see when exactly Cheung Siu-chung's
heart stop beating.

65
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:37,840
Assume Tang Suk-han killed Cheung Siu-chung,

66
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:39,680
it was in a fit of rage.

67
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:43,600
When she found the watch
Cheung Tai-di dropped,

68
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:46,840
she realized it stopped at 12:05.

69
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:50,640
If Tang Suk-han really killed
Cheung Siu-chung,

70
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:55,280
it's likely she destroyed
the second trust fund document.

71
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,000
Though she's a prime suspect,

72
00:03:57,280 --> 00:04:00,000
we don't have any solid proof.

73
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,560
We still must let her go.

74
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,480
Right!

75
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:06,480
The Police took old Mrs. Cheung
back to the Police station.

76
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:09,200
I heard it's about Chung's death.

77
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:12,200
The cops suspect she killed Chung?

78
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:14,000
Why would she kill her grandson?

79
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:15,840
Didn't you know?

80
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,040
No!

81
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:21,440
What? No wonder!

82
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:23,640
Must be. What else would they want with her?

83
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:24,520
Her cooking?

84
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:27,840
The Chief seemed so upright.

85
00:04:27,960 --> 00:04:30,200
He certainly kept it in the family.

86
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:33,200
Men like it handy.

87
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:33,960
What?

88
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:37,400
Young Mrs. Cheung is still charming.

89
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:40,160
But who could commit incest?

90
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,920
Exactly!
Your turn!

91
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,480
Look, I'm not afraid to speak my mind.

92
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:47,760
The Chief's wife is old and over the hill.

93
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:50,720
She thinks because she's the Chief's wife,
she's entitled to bully others.

94
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:53,360
But young Mrs. Cheung is so much
more amiable.

95
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:56,160
Naturally, the Chief prefers the
daughter-in-law over the wife.

96
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,760
Don't say that...
That's not right...

97
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:58,520
How could you...

98
00:04:58,640 --> 00:05:02,560
I felt bad that old Mrs. Cheung was
betrayed by her husband and daughter-in-law,

99
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,200
but it wasn't Chung's fault.

100
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:05,840
Chung was so adorable,

101
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,840
how could she do it? That's so cruel!

102
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,640
That's true...
So sad...

103
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:13,360
I must go get groceries...
What?

104
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,760
Look at the time...
I have won enough...

105
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:17,040
I need to pick up my grandson from school.

106
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,960
How did they know?

107
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,960
This is so humiliating.

108
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:23,760
It wasn't me. I said nothing.

109
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:26,480
People nowadays can't tell right from wrong.

110
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:28,720
It was that tramp's fault,

111
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:30,960
but they sounded like I made a mistake.

112
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:32,400
What has the world come to?

113
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:34,400
In the mourning hall,

114
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:38,200
I will get seven Taoist priests and
two musicians

115
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:41,360
for the Breaking of the Gates of Hell and
Crossing the Bridge rituals.

116
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:46,240
Leung Yuet-ping, it must be you.

117
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:48,000
You badmouthed me in front of the villagers

118
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:49,840
and told them I deserved what I got.

119
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:53,760
You seduced my husband. You're the tramp.

120
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:55,760
This is nothing to be proud of.

121
00:05:55,840 --> 00:05:57,520
Why would I tell anyone?

122
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:59,200
Please don't argue.

123
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:03,080
And you! Why did you tell the Police
about us?

124
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:05,520
They questioned me. I had to tell them.

125
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:07,760
But I didn't tell anyone else.

126
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,360
Maybe when the Police was conducting
their investigation,

127
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:11,040
the villagers found out on their own.

128
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:15,640
You just didn't want people to know
you went to see Chung in the village house.

129
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:18,080
You were afraid people would
find out what you did.

130
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:20,480
I told you I didn't kill Chung.

131
00:06:21,320 --> 00:06:25,040
He really pissed me off
and I shoved him into the cabinet.

132
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:27,600
But he was still alive when I left.

133
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:31,360
Just because the Police let you out
doesn't mean you didn't kill anyone.

134
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:34,520
They'll soon find evidence
to prove you're the killer.

135
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:37,280
Brother Nam, let's talk outside.

136
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:40,160
I don't want to be in the same room
with a murderer.

137
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:41,360
You better get out!

138
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:44,720
If you piss me off, I'll kill you as well.

139
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:52,400
Have you seen your father?

140
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:53,760
No.

141
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:56,400
You know nothing.

142
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:59,520
Chi...

143
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:09,360
Cuckold...
It suits you...

144
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:10,640
Chi...

145
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,320
Let's go...

146
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:13,920
Why did you bully my son?

147
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:16,720
Chi is a cuckold. See? He looks great!

148
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:20,720
Delete that! Go to Hell!

149
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,200
You better pay for my phone.

150
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:25,640
Get lost or I'll crush you!

151
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,800
You're a lunatic!

152
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:29,040
I'll kill you if you bully Chi again.

153
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:30,640
I will kill you!

154
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:35,200
Chi, are you OK?

155
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,600
It hurts...

156
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:40,640
You need someone to watch over you.

157
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:43,280
Let's go home and I'll put something on it.

158
00:07:44,400 --> 00:07:47,040
Where the hell is Chau?

159
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,080
This is so infuriating!

160
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:52,880
I told you not to go out by yourself.

161
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:55,840
When I'm not here, no one will
keep an eye on you.

162
00:07:56,200 --> 00:08:00,200
To think I can count on that tramp
to carry on the family line

163
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:03,600
and Chung would take care of you.

164
00:08:04,320 --> 00:08:06,200
Nothing is going as planned

165
00:08:06,760 --> 00:08:08,640
and we ended up with an illegitimate son.

166
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:12,480
Don't be mad, Mom.

167
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:17,440
I'll avoid them from now on.

168
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:20,400
You're gullible because of your kind heart.

169
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:23,600
Tell me, I threw away Chung's watch,

170
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:27,120
why did you put it back in my room?

171
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:31,760
I saw you throw away Chung B's watch,

172
00:08:32,160 --> 00:08:34,560
I got it back for you.

173
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:39,440
That's not how you usually talk.

174
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:44,240
Are you reciting these lines?

175
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:48,320
I saw you throw away Chung B's watch,

176
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:50,880
I got it back for you.

177
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:52,640
What about the jacket?

178
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,400
Madam Han!
What?

179
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:56,240
Your feng shui jade gourd is broken.

180
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:58,880
Go take a look!
How did that happen?

181
00:08:58,960 --> 00:08:59,440
Yes!

182
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:04,320
Oh dear, what happened?

183
00:09:04,400 --> 00:09:05,840
I don't know. I was working in the kitchen

184
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,200
I heard a bang and came to take a look.

185
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:09,120
Maybe the rats knocked it down?

186
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:12,080
Don't! You may cut yourself!

187
00:09:12,280 --> 00:09:14,000
I wonder if it can be fixed.

188
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,760
Not if it's shattered like this.

189
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:19,520
I had this jade gourd for decades.

190
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:23,840
Let's hope breaking it can block
my bad luck.

191
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,680
Clean it up.

192
00:09:25,800 --> 00:09:26,480
OK!

193
00:09:33,520 --> 00:09:36,720
Chi...

194
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:39,280
What is it?

195
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,720
What are you doing here?

196
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,880
This is my room.

197
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,640
Why can't I be here?

198
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:48,720
Mom, please go away.

199
00:09:49,280 --> 00:09:53,040
You complain I don't take good enough
care of Chi.

200
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:57,360
Now, I'm doing my best. See?

201
00:09:57,600 --> 00:10:00,000
Honey...

202
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,600
Please leave us alone.

203
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:17,600
Morning, Madam Han.

204
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,480
Where's Chi?

205
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:21,360
It's late. They didn't come down
for breakfast?

206
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,160
No...

207
00:10:24,760 --> 00:10:27,280
Where are you going so early
with a travel bag?

208
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,720
Chi is still in bed?

209
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:31,280
He was up all night.

210
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:32,640
I'm going up to him.

211
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:36,080
Don't bother. He left early with me.

212
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:36,880
He's not in his room.

213
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:38,480
Where did he go?

214
00:10:38,640 --> 00:10:40,320
Since I'm such an eyesore to you,

215
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:42,080
we're moving out.

216
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:44,480
If you want to leave, go ahead.

217
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:46,640
Why did you bring Chi with you?

218
00:10:46,800 --> 00:10:48,920
You're funny. He's my husband.

219
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:50,400
Of course we must move together.

220
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:53,200
Never break up a couple.

221
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,880
How vicious of you!

222
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:57,840
You're hiding him and won't let me see him.

223
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,440
Why would I need to hide him?

224
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:01,440
He's my husband, would I kidnap him?

225
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:03,600
If he wants to see you, he will contact you.

226
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:05,200
Madam Han, you want breakfast?

227
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:09,120
What's wrong with you? You're so clumsy!

228
00:11:09,200 --> 00:11:10,800
I'm sorry! I...I'll get you a towel.

229
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,680
I'm back.

230
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:22,720
Honey, where were you?

231
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:26,000
You were gone after I finished wee wee.

232
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:30,720
I bought you new coloring pens and
a coloring book.

233
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:35,440
Then I saw this bag. Isn't it pretty?

234
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:38,800
I don't want to do coloring.

235
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:42,640
I want to go to the DAC. I missed Mom.

236
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,720
I already told you,

237
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:51,440
Father and Chung B are gone,

238
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:54,000
Mother must be very upset.

239
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:58,240
She wanted to stay in this
Presidential Suite of the hotel.

240
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:01,520
But we must stay here for a month
before we can book it.

241
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,760
You want Mother to be happy, right?

242
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:06,640
I want Mom to be happy.

243
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:09,520
But...why must we hide?

244
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:11,680
Why can't we go back to the DAC?

245
00:12:11,760 --> 00:12:14,240
And why... no phone calls?

246
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:17,680
Because it's a surprise.

247
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:21,360
Just think, if Mother asks you,

248
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:23,680
you're likely to tell her everything.

249
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:25,440
She'll bring you home

250
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:30,000
and ruin our whole plan, right?

251
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,880
Come...see what I got you.

252
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:36,160
See? It's a big car.

253
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:41,920
Color pencils...look, coloring book.

254
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,840
That will keep you busy for a month.

255
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:46,000
So big...

256
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:48,320
Wait...stop playing.

257
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:52,720
What about your homework?
Did you memorize it?

258
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:53,680
Yes!

259
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:55,200
I'll test you.

260
00:12:56,320 --> 00:13:00,320
Why did you put Chung B's watch
in Mother's room?

261
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:10,240
I booked the mourning hall for Chung
on November 2.

262
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:13,280
The next day, the body will go into storage.

263
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:15,440
The feng shui master said

264
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:18,080
he'll pick another auspicious day
for his burial.

265
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:21,760
He will be buried in the family cemetery.

266
00:13:22,040 --> 00:13:27,360
Wait! I want Chung buried at sea.

267
00:13:27,800 --> 00:13:29,760
What?
Why?

268
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:31,280
Why bury him at sea?

269
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:34,080
Mother, I know you're now
the head of the family,

270
00:13:34,160 --> 00:13:35,200
and I should respect you.

271
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:38,080
But Chung is a member of the Cheung family,

272
00:13:38,640 --> 00:13:41,840
he should be buried with Father and
his ancestors.

273
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:44,160
I know you hate Chung,

274
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:49,040
but I can't let him die without
a burial place.

275
00:13:49,920 --> 00:13:51,200
I have my reasons.

276
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:52,880
I don't need to explain myself.

277
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:57,200
You're his grandmother, but I'm his mother.

278
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:59,760
Please let me make this decision for him.

279
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,800
I don't want Chung to suffer anymore.

280
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:07,520
Cousin Han, Chung had an epilepsy attack
when he was young and almost drowned.

281
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:09,120
He was afraid of water all his life.

282
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,880
If you bury him at sea,

283
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:12,800
he'll never find peace.

284
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:15,840
That's right!
What gives?

285
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:18,800
A proper burial beats burial at sea...
This is outrageous!

286
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:20,720
Shut up, all of you!

287
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:24,800
Don't let this woman con you with
her pathetic act.

288
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:27,440
She only seems becoming,
she's vicious inside.

289
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:29,280
We all have skeletons in the closet.

290
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:31,840
Butt out of our family business.

291
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,760
You can't say that.
That's right!

292
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:36,080
We're all from the Cheung ancestors.

293
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:38,320
The Chief left us,
his business is our business, right?

294
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:40,560
That's right...
Exactly!

295
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:43,840
Mother, go ahead and hate me.

296
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,760
But Chung had nothing to do with this.

297
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:49,360
Whatever reason killed him,
he's no longer with us,

298
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:52,880
please go easy on him.

299
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:54,480
That's right!

300
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:57,120
Quit you act! Go to Hell!

301
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:59,440
You hit her?!
That's outrageous!

302
00:14:59,520 --> 00:15:01,360
How could you?
This is not right...

303
00:15:01,640 --> 00:15:02,920
Cousin Han, why did you hit her?

304
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:06,000
Don't you get rough...
You have no proof...

305
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:08,240
Let's go!
Where are you taking her?

306
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:09,840
Anywhere we want.

307
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:11,840
You should not get rough...
That's outrageous!

308
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:13,360
You'll get your retribution...
Let go of me!

309
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:15,840
That's enough, Grandma! Will you calm down?

310
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:18,240
People will think you're the baddie
if you keep this up.

311
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:20,160
I don't care!

312
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:22,080
That tramp sheds a few tears

313
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:23,520
and everyone is on her side.

314
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:26,000
There's no justice in this world.

315
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:30,920
Miss Ma!

316
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:32,560
Something came up at home.

317
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:34,400
I wish to pick up Cheung Wang Chi early.

318
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:38,240
Mrs. Cheung already withdrew
Cheung Wang Chi from class this morning.

319
00:15:39,520 --> 00:15:42,720
Did she say which DAC she's taking him?

320
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:44,000
No, she didn't.

321
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:45,600
Excuse me, I have work to do.

322
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,680
(Tap Tung Island)

323
00:15:53,920 --> 00:15:54,800
Mom?

324
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:59,920
You think my drawing...
will get posted on the board?

325
00:16:00,160 --> 00:16:03,440
Of course! It's so pretty.

326
00:16:04,400 --> 00:16:05,520
Hello?
Hello?

327
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:07,120
Chau?
Yes, Madam Han?

328
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:10,240
Remember a long time ago,
I went to Tap Tung Island.

329
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:12,400
I forgot how to get there.

330
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:15,040
Do you know the way? Can you take me?

331
00:16:15,360 --> 00:16:16,960
I don't know.

332
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:19,120
I'm getting groceries now. I can't take you.

333
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,600
Forget it!

334
00:16:22,400 --> 00:16:24,080
Get me the file from four years ago.

335
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:25,520
Go on in.

336
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:27,280
Hello, Grandma? What is it?

337
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:30,480
I want to go to Tap Tung Island.

338
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:32,800
Can you tell me how to get there?

339
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:35,920
Take a taxi to Wong Shek Pier
and take the ferry from there.

340
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:36,640
Why do you want to go there?

341
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:40,080
Nothing. Just for a walk.

342
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:44,480
You conned me to Tap Tung Island.

343
00:16:44,680 --> 00:16:46,080
They don't have seafood.

344
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:46,840
(A year ago)

345
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:50,840
But we had a good time, right?

346
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,480
It's pretty out here.

347
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:56,320
Better than fighting with Mom at home.

348
00:16:57,600 --> 00:17:00,920
You're so good at cheering people up.

349
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,840
I know you're a good kid.

350
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:05,040
Whatever makes you happy, Grandma.

351
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,320
(The night of the incident)

352
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:11,080
It's been five days. Where are you?

353
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:14,160
Hello, Chung? Have you eaten?

354
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:17,440
Yes!

355
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:20,000
The trust fund Mr. Mok set up for you

356
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:22,640
will be effective from the day
you specified.

357
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:25,520
Trust fund?
OK! Good.

358
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:27,880
Be careful, bye.

359
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,120
If you take a taxi,

360
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:44,280
tell the driver No. 38 Wan Mei Village.

361
00:17:46,640 --> 00:17:48,960
What trust fund?

362
00:17:50,520 --> 00:17:53,800
I wonder how Chung will divide up the money?

363
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:57,840
I better go talk to him.

364
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:02,720
Chung likes sugarcanes.

365
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:04,800
Hi, Wong Kee!
Yes?

366
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:05,640
I want a sugarcane.

367
00:18:05,840 --> 00:18:08,800
Cousin Han, what are you getting
at this late hour?

368
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:10,720
Fancy running into you.

369
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,280
Are you busy?

370
00:18:12,360 --> 00:18:13,680
I need you to take me somewhere.

371
00:18:13,840 --> 00:18:15,640
Take me to Wan Mei Village.

372
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:17,120
Wan Mei Village?

373
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,960
I don't know my way there.

374
00:18:19,040 --> 00:18:20,400
What?
Hang on...

375
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:21,840
OK!

376
00:18:25,720 --> 00:18:27,200
This should be it.

377
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:30,000
Wait for me in the car.

378
00:18:30,200 --> 00:18:31,320
Call me.

379
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:36,800
Grandma? How did you find me?

380
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:38,520
You're not mad at me anymore?

381
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:41,040
Am I not welcome here?

382
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:45,120
You're always welcome! Come on in!

383
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:47,640
I bought your favorite sugarcane.

384
00:18:47,920 --> 00:18:48,960
Thanks, Grandma!

385
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:55,120
A lot happened lately
and I'm in a foul mood.

386
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:59,440
I didn't mean to yell at you.

387
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:03,880
It's OK. As long as you're not
mad at me anymore.

388
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:06,800
Good boy!

389
00:19:07,600 --> 00:19:09,080
You're still young.

390
00:19:09,320 --> 00:19:12,640
You should seek my advice, OK?

391
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:15,800
For instance, the inheritance...

392
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:19,120
I got it all sorted out.

393
00:19:19,360 --> 00:19:21,440
I set up a trust fund,

394
00:19:21,800 --> 00:19:24,120
Mom will get the house...

395
00:19:24,600 --> 00:19:28,320
What? The tramp gets the house?

396
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:31,520
No, only on the condition

397
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:35,080
you and Dad have both passed away,

398
00:19:35,280 --> 00:19:39,120
before it can be rented or sold.

399
00:19:39,320 --> 00:19:42,640
I don't care. I don't want that tramp
to get the house.

400
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:45,360
I want you to change the trust fund.

401
00:19:45,840 --> 00:19:51,600
This arrangement is to ensure
no more arguments.

402
00:19:52,080 --> 00:19:56,640
I'll explain to all of you tomorrow.

403
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:58,800
Don't be angry.

404
00:19:59,040 --> 00:20:02,720
Have some sugarcane, it's sweet.

405
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:12,000
The sight of you eating sugarcane
infuriates me.

406
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:13,760
You remind me of Grandpa.

407
00:20:13,840 --> 00:20:17,440
Go to Hell! I raised a traitor!
You're an ingrate like him!

408
00:20:17,520 --> 00:20:20,080
No, Grandma!
Don't call me Grandma!

409
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:22,360
You can't get anything done.

410
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,720
Chung!

411
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:33,920
Chung!

412
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:40,000
Chung!

413
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:46,560
Grandma, trust me. This is the best way.

414
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:50,040
Why won't you listen?

415
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:56,040
Let's go home.

416
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:08,360
If Chung comes home tomorrow to
announce the trust fund,

417
00:21:08,440 --> 00:21:09,680
there'll be big trouble.

418
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:15,040
How can I change his mind?

419
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:23,880
Hello?

420
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:25,680
Grandma? Something happened to Chung.

421
00:21:25,760 --> 00:21:26,840
What is it?

422
00:21:27,040 --> 00:21:28,720
The paramedics are trying to revive him.

423
00:21:28,840 --> 00:21:31,320
I called Mom and Dad,
but they're not picking up.

424
00:21:31,520 --> 00:21:32,880
Can you go wake them up?

425
00:21:33,080 --> 00:21:36,160
Open the door! Get up!

426
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:37,680
What is it?

427
00:21:37,800 --> 00:21:40,840
Tai-di just called.
Something bad happened to Chung.

428
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:41,360
What?

429
00:21:41,440 --> 00:21:42,520
They're giving him emergency resuscitation.

430
00:21:42,600 --> 00:21:45,440
The paramedics suspect when Cheung Siu-chung
was eating sugarcane,

431
00:21:45,520 --> 00:21:47,760
scraps went inside his trachea by mistake
and caused him to suffocate.

432
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:51,920
Chung, I'm so sorry!

433
00:21:53,520 --> 00:21:56,640
If I didn't bring you sugarcane,

434
00:21:58,400 --> 00:22:01,280
you wouldn't have choked on it.

435
00:22:27,800 --> 00:22:29,040
Chung's watch?

436
00:22:29,480 --> 00:22:31,640
If Mr. Cheung Siu-chung was 21 years old,

437
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:33,320
he was entitled to inherit the estate.

438
00:22:33,440 --> 00:22:34,720
12:05a.m.?

439
00:22:35,720 --> 00:22:38,480
I shouldn't have picked up the watch.

440
00:22:38,560 --> 00:22:40,400
Then I wouldn't be in trouble.

441
00:22:49,320 --> 00:22:50,880
Grandma, what are they doing?

442
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:53,440
They're giving a family member
a burial at sea.

443
00:22:54,120 --> 00:22:56,000
What's that?

444
00:22:56,280 --> 00:22:59,600
It means to scatter the ashes at sea.

445
00:23:02,040 --> 00:23:04,360
Grandma, I want a burial at sea.

446
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:08,160
Touch wood! Don't talk nonsense.

447
00:23:08,400 --> 00:23:13,360
I'm serious. I love swimming.

448
00:23:13,520 --> 00:23:17,440
But Mom won't let me because of my spasm.

449
00:23:18,120 --> 00:23:21,560
If I'm buried at sea,
then I can swim freely.

450
00:23:26,800 --> 00:23:28,280
You want bean curd pudding?

451
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:33,920
No, excuse me...do you know
where they scatter ashes at sea?

452
00:23:34,480 --> 00:23:36,160
I'm not sure.

453
00:23:36,360 --> 00:23:41,200
But people usually take the boat
and go west.

454
00:23:41,520 --> 00:23:43,840
You need to bury someone at sea?

455
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:48,080
My grandson passed away.

456
00:23:48,760 --> 00:23:51,040
I promised to bury him at sea.

457
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:54,960
I want to take a look at his resting place.

458
00:23:55,680 --> 00:23:58,840
Go that way and you can see it.

459
00:24:03,080 --> 00:24:06,960
Should I go this way or this way?

460
00:24:07,440 --> 00:24:11,440
Oh no. Which way should I go?

461
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:20,120
Hello, Auntie Chau? Is this important?

462
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:20,960
I'm in a meeting.

463
00:24:21,040 --> 00:24:22,880
Is Madam Han home for dinner?

464
00:24:22,960 --> 00:24:24,720
I called her several times
but she didn't pick up.

465
00:24:24,800 --> 00:24:26,280
Didn't you go to Tap Tung Island with her?

466
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:28,400
No, I have too much work to do.

467
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:30,840
OK, I'll try to find her.

468
00:24:33,120 --> 00:24:35,440
The number you dialed cannot be reached.

469
00:24:35,520 --> 00:24:36,480
Please call again later...

470
00:24:39,320 --> 00:24:41,760
Ms. Cheung, Anson is asking for you.

471
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:42,800
OK!

472
00:24:43,320 --> 00:24:45,920
Grandma, where are you? Call me back.

473
00:24:46,960 --> 00:24:49,080
I talked for ten minutes. About what?

474
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:50,280
Follow up is important.

475
00:24:50,480 --> 00:24:52,800
I don't need to remind you of the stamping.

476
00:24:53,120 --> 00:24:53,920
Before we go to court,

477
00:24:54,040 --> 00:24:56,560
I already agreed with the opposing counsel
to settle.

478
00:24:56,960 --> 00:24:57,920
OK!

479
00:25:00,040 --> 00:25:02,640
Anson, I'm sorry!
There's something urgent at home.

480
00:25:02,760 --> 00:25:03,560
Can I leave early?

481
00:25:03,640 --> 00:25:04,720
No problem!

482
00:25:05,120 --> 00:25:06,080
Great. Thanks!

483
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:08,160
Call me if you need me.
OK!

484
00:25:08,360 --> 00:25:08,880
Thanks a lot!

485
00:25:13,840 --> 00:25:16,960
Excuse me...have you seen her?

486
00:25:17,160 --> 00:25:20,160
Yes! She said she wanted her grandson
to be buried at sea

487
00:25:20,320 --> 00:25:21,560
and came to check out the surroundings.

488
00:25:21,640 --> 00:25:22,800
She went that way.

489
00:25:23,000 --> 00:25:24,320
Great! Thank you!

490
00:25:29,120 --> 00:25:30,320
No signal?

491
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:40,240
It's Tai-di! Hello, Tai-di?

492
00:25:40,320 --> 00:25:41,920
Grandma, where are you?

493
00:25:42,040 --> 00:25:44,120
I sprained my ankle.

494
00:25:44,320 --> 00:25:46,760
I don't know where I am.

495
00:25:46,840 --> 00:25:50,120
Calm down. Describe your surroundings.

496
00:25:50,200 --> 00:25:53,800
Trees...nothing but trees.

497
00:25:53,880 --> 00:25:55,200
I don't know where I am.

498
00:25:55,280 --> 00:25:58,000
Come get me! Hurry...Hello?

499
00:25:58,200 --> 00:26:00,160
Hello, Grandma?

500
00:26:00,360 --> 00:26:03,040
Oh dear! The phone went dead.

501
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:05,080
What will happen now?

502
00:26:11,320 --> 00:26:16,000
Help...Help...

503
00:26:16,080 --> 00:26:16,800
Grandma!

504
00:26:19,000 --> 00:26:22,520
What took you so long?

505
00:26:23,040 --> 00:26:24,360
Where are you hurt?

506
00:26:24,440 --> 00:26:26,360
I sprained my foot.

507
00:26:26,440 --> 00:26:27,280
Let me see...

508
00:26:28,120 --> 00:26:30,880
You probably can't walk. I'll carry you.

509
00:26:31,080 --> 00:26:34,280
How? You're so skinny?

510
00:26:34,360 --> 00:26:36,240
You better not drop me on the ground.

511
00:26:36,320 --> 00:26:41,560
Hurry! You're so slow.

512
00:26:41,800 --> 00:26:44,120
You're barely moving in those high heels.

513
00:26:44,520 --> 00:26:47,360
If we missed the last ferry,
we won't get home.

514
00:26:51,320 --> 00:26:54,840
Oh dear! Look...there goes the last ferry!

515
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:57,840
Why are you so slow?

516
00:26:57,920 --> 00:26:59,560
How can you be a lawyer?

517
00:27:10,640 --> 00:27:12,880
Grandma, I love swimming.

518
00:27:13,040 --> 00:27:14,280
I want a burial at sea.

519
00:27:14,360 --> 00:27:16,880
Touch wood! Don't talk nonsense!

520
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:18,640
You must follow the family tradition

521
00:27:18,760 --> 00:27:20,240
and be buried in the family cemetery.

522
00:27:20,360 --> 00:27:22,040
Let's go take the ferry...

523
00:27:22,120 --> 00:27:24,960
Bite your tongue! Don't talk nonsense!

524
00:27:25,080 --> 00:27:27,800
No, I really love swimming.

525
00:27:27,880 --> 00:27:29,680
That's why I want to be buried at sea.

526
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:51,120
Here!

527
00:27:52,160 --> 00:27:53,360
What is it?

528
00:27:54,200 --> 00:27:57,200
Honey lemon with tangerine peel.
You asked for it.

529
00:27:59,840 --> 00:28:01,440
It's too sour!

530
00:28:03,120 --> 00:28:04,280
I'll fix you something to eat.

531
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:36,960
I saw you throw away the watch,

532
00:28:37,040 --> 00:28:39,760
I'm scared...it's so hard...

533
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:41,880
Make sure you memorize the lines.

534
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:44,320
They'll come in handy.

535
00:28:44,840 --> 00:28:47,440
This is called planning ahead.

536
00:28:48,120 --> 00:28:52,600
I have had enough for over 20 years.

537
00:28:53,160 --> 00:28:55,720
Use your hand and scrub.

538
00:28:55,960 --> 00:29:00,880
Just because you married into this family,
doesn't mean you're precious.

539
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:04,560
Kin-kwok has the final say in this house
and Chi is most precious.

540
00:29:04,920 --> 00:29:07,360
You take good care of him,
you're the young lady of the house.

541
00:29:07,440 --> 00:29:11,120
If not, you're no different from the maid.

542
00:29:11,560 --> 00:29:16,600
Father, what must I do
before Mother will be satisfied?

543
00:29:20,760 --> 00:29:23,280
Don't do this...

544
00:29:23,560 --> 00:29:26,880
Listen, at the next meeting of
the village office,

545
00:29:26,960 --> 00:29:28,240
I'll bring you along.

546
00:29:28,480 --> 00:29:30,400
You can help out over there

547
00:29:30,480 --> 00:29:32,760
and when you're done,
go shopping and take a break, OK?

548
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:35,800
Really, Father?
Yes...

549
00:29:37,280 --> 00:29:38,480
Thank you, Father.

550
00:29:39,560 --> 00:29:41,760
Kin-kwok has the final say in this house.

551
00:29:49,400 --> 00:29:52,600
Remember I told you not to touch me
right there?

552
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:54,480
It hurts when you touch me.

553
00:29:54,720 --> 00:29:56,720
I'll be gentle.

554
00:29:56,920 --> 00:29:58,880
It still hurts.

555
00:30:01,240 --> 00:30:04,800
If you love me, don't touch me there.

556
00:30:05,200 --> 00:30:07,040
You don't want to hurt me, right?

557
00:30:08,080 --> 00:30:09,120
Right.

558
00:30:09,720 --> 00:30:10,960
Turn over that way.

559
00:30:22,200 --> 00:30:24,560
Father, what are you doing?

560
00:30:25,160 --> 00:30:26,400
Auntie Chau is here.

561
00:30:27,240 --> 00:30:30,880
No, Father! Did you wear a condom?

562
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:31,680
I ran out.

563
00:30:31,920 --> 00:30:34,360
You can't...

564
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:35,880
Why not? I always can...

565
00:30:37,240 --> 00:30:38,840
What now? I'm pregnant!

566
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:41,120
You are? Mine?

567
00:30:41,240 --> 00:30:44,160
Of course! Chi never touched me.

568
00:30:44,400 --> 00:30:47,040
I don't care, I'm getting an abortion.

569
00:30:47,160 --> 00:30:50,840
Don't do that...
Just say it's Chi's baby.

570
00:30:50,960 --> 00:30:52,400
Chi is mentally challenged,

571
00:30:52,520 --> 00:30:56,880
if you give him a smart son,
I will have an heir.

572
00:30:57,080 --> 00:30:59,360
I married Chi to take care of him.

573
00:30:59,440 --> 00:31:01,040
I have no intention to bear child.

574
00:31:01,280 --> 00:31:05,120
If you give me a son,
I'll make it worthwhile for you.

575
00:31:05,400 --> 00:31:07,360
I'll give you $500K to start.

576
00:31:07,520 --> 00:31:10,400
Another $5M after the baby is born.

577
00:31:10,600 --> 00:31:12,720
You can do anything you want after that.

578
00:31:13,040 --> 00:31:15,920
You promised me $5M after
the baby is born.

579
00:31:16,160 --> 00:31:18,760
What's the meaning of $50K?

580
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:22,000
When you married Chi, you had no
intention to bear child.

581
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:25,760
It's a job and you're after money.

582
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:28,760
Of course! You can't be so naive

583
00:31:28,840 --> 00:31:30,800
to think I married him for his personality.

584
00:31:31,000 --> 00:31:33,360
I have no hope for Chi.

585
00:31:33,560 --> 00:31:34,400
Let me ask you,

586
00:31:34,880 --> 00:31:39,440
what kind of employer would pay
his employee the whole lump sum?

587
00:31:39,680 --> 00:31:45,520
Relax! You'll get your $5M...
in installments.

588
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:48,960
You're Chung's Mom and Chi's wife.

589
00:31:49,120 --> 00:31:52,720
As long as you stay in this family,
you'll get paid by month.

590
00:31:52,920 --> 00:31:55,320
The longer you stay, the more you make.

591
00:31:55,520 --> 00:31:56,960
You didn't keep your end of the bargain.

592
00:31:57,120 --> 00:31:58,840
I'll expose you.

593
00:31:58,920 --> 00:32:02,840
Oh, I'm so scared. This is a business deal.

594
00:32:03,440 --> 00:32:06,160
You shoot off your mouth,
we'll both be ruined.

595
00:32:06,480 --> 00:32:09,680
Why not go for a win-win situation?

596
00:32:09,880 --> 00:32:13,440
If you stay and please me,

597
00:32:13,560 --> 00:32:18,480
this house will be yours, understand?

598
00:32:20,120 --> 00:32:25,120
Chung is my son with your husband,
my father-in-law.

599
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:26,560
What?

600
00:32:37,080 --> 00:32:41,920
Chung is my son with your husband,
my father-in-law.

601
00:32:42,120 --> 00:32:46,040
I hate you. Why did you do it?
Chung...

602
00:32:46,120 --> 00:32:47,600
Listen to me.
No!

603
00:32:47,680 --> 00:32:50,000
I don't want to listen.

604
00:32:51,200 --> 00:32:54,880
You had Chung B with Dad?

605
00:32:55,520 --> 00:32:57,920
You made me a cuckold!

606
00:32:58,600 --> 00:33:03,120
I didn't mean to. Father forced me...

607
00:33:04,040 --> 00:33:04,880
What?

608
00:33:06,240 --> 00:33:09,840
One time when nobody was home,
Father forced me to sleep with him.

609
00:33:10,040 --> 00:33:14,960
I was pregnant with Chung
but didn't dare tell you.

610
00:33:15,040 --> 00:33:16,880
I was afraid you'd kick me out.

611
00:33:17,600 --> 00:33:19,560
That's why every time you touch me,

612
00:33:20,720 --> 00:33:22,560
I would think of your father...

613
00:33:26,680 --> 00:33:28,800
It hasn't been easy for me.

614
00:33:32,520 --> 00:33:36,400
That's why I lied to you. I'm sorry.

615
00:33:36,760 --> 00:33:41,320
I'm not angry with you, or Chung B.

616
00:33:41,960 --> 00:33:46,400
Really? Then you must protect me.

617
00:33:47,360 --> 00:33:48,960
You must listen to me

618
00:33:50,160 --> 00:33:52,200
and say anything I want you to say.

619
00:33:52,440 --> 00:33:53,520
OK!

620
00:34:03,120 --> 00:34:06,360
(One day before the incident)

621
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:08,960
Chung, even if you give me the house,

622
00:34:09,040 --> 00:34:12,960
Grandma will live there till she dies
before I can sell or rent.

623
00:34:13,200 --> 00:34:14,720
What if I die before she does?

624
00:34:14,800 --> 00:34:16,080
Then I'll get nothing.

625
00:34:16,280 --> 00:34:19,120
You won't die before she does.

626
00:34:19,680 --> 00:34:21,840
I want the family to be together.

627
00:34:21,920 --> 00:34:24,240
No! Stay right there! We must sort this out.

628
00:34:24,360 --> 00:34:26,000
I don't want to listen to you.
Chung...

629
00:34:26,080 --> 00:34:27,120
I don't want to see you anymore.

630
00:34:27,200 --> 00:34:28,400
Why are you doing this to me?

631
00:34:41,280 --> 00:34:42,320
Chung's watch?

632
00:34:42,640 --> 00:34:47,600
After Mom took back her jacket...

633
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:51,360
I heard a noise in the trash

634
00:34:51,840 --> 00:34:55,280
and I saw Chung B's watch.

635
00:34:56,240 --> 00:34:59,520
Your mother threw away the jacket
and the watch.

636
00:35:00,040 --> 00:35:01,840
You picked up the jacket

637
00:35:02,200 --> 00:35:03,760
and the watch fell into the trash can.

638
00:35:04,000 --> 00:35:07,040
Maybe Mom was angry with Chung B

639
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:10,800
and threw away the watch along with
the jacket.

640
00:35:11,240 --> 00:35:15,200
I didn't want to part with it,
and picked it up.

641
00:35:15,360 --> 00:35:16,960
Tai-di said she dropped the watch.

642
00:35:17,160 --> 00:35:19,360
The old hag found it but didn't say anything

643
00:35:19,600 --> 00:35:21,240
and secretly threw it away.

644
00:35:21,480 --> 00:35:22,640
She obviously had something to hide.

645
00:35:22,880 --> 00:35:24,720
I'd be letting myself down
if I didn't frame you.

646
00:35:25,080 --> 00:35:27,680
Good job, Chi!

647
00:35:28,000 --> 00:35:31,520
Thanks to you, we get to keep
Chung B's watch.

648
00:35:31,800 --> 00:35:34,680
Your mother must be furious

649
00:35:34,760 --> 00:35:35,920
that's why she threw away the watch.

650
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:39,040
When she gets over being angry with Chung B,

651
00:35:39,160 --> 00:35:41,280
she'll regret that she threw the watch away.

652
00:35:41,480 --> 00:35:44,080
I'll keep it for her

653
00:35:44,160 --> 00:35:47,520
and give it back when she's not angry.

654
00:35:47,640 --> 00:35:49,040
That's not a good idea.

655
00:35:49,320 --> 00:35:51,720
What if you lost the watch?

656
00:35:52,360 --> 00:35:56,080
You should keep it where she can't find it.

657
00:35:56,320 --> 00:36:00,120
In a drawer in her room...

658
00:36:00,280 --> 00:36:03,440
Remember it was your idea

659
00:36:03,760 --> 00:36:05,840
and you never told me.

660
00:36:06,080 --> 00:36:07,520
We must keep it a secret.

661
00:36:08,560 --> 00:36:09,640
OK!

662
00:36:14,240 --> 00:36:16,880
She kept the jacket, where is it?

663
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:21,040
Wait...I have one too.

664
00:36:22,760 --> 00:36:26,000
You like my jacket?

665
00:36:26,120 --> 00:36:27,840
It's a gift from a friend.

666
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:30,560
I'll wear it to a friend's dinner party.

667
00:36:30,640 --> 00:36:32,800
It's very nice. Look at the material. See?

668
00:36:54,280 --> 00:36:56,080
What is it doing here?

669
00:36:58,160 --> 00:37:01,440
Tell me, I threw away Chung's watch,

670
00:37:01,680 --> 00:37:04,160
why did you put it back in my room?

671
00:37:04,360 --> 00:37:08,000
Rats! I can't let her
badger Chi with questions.

672
00:37:08,080 --> 00:37:10,320
I saw you throw away Chung B's watch...

673
00:37:10,400 --> 00:37:11,720
Auntie Chau...

674
00:37:11,920 --> 00:37:12,640
What is it?

675
00:37:12,720 --> 00:37:14,240
Go upstairs and tell Madam Han

676
00:37:14,360 --> 00:37:16,400
her feng shui jade gourd fell and broke

677
00:37:16,480 --> 00:37:17,760
You'll get an extra $1,000 every month.

678
00:37:18,040 --> 00:37:19,120
What about the jacket?

679
00:37:19,200 --> 00:37:21,680
Madam Han!
Your feng shui jade gourd is broken.

680
00:37:22,000 --> 00:37:24,320
How did that happen?
Yes!

681
00:37:25,000 --> 00:37:25,680
Chi!

682
00:37:26,160 --> 00:37:26,960
Honey?

683
00:37:27,080 --> 00:37:28,880
Take off your clothes.

684
00:37:28,960 --> 00:37:31,240
What?
Hurry! Take them off...

685
00:37:31,760 --> 00:37:34,720
Can we kiss kiss?

686
00:37:34,800 --> 00:37:37,680
Yes, but you must do the bunny hop

687
00:37:37,760 --> 00:37:39,360
until I tell you to stop.

688
00:37:39,480 --> 00:37:40,680
Hurry...

689
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:50,160
Chi...

690
00:37:51,400 --> 00:37:52,560
What is it?

691
00:37:52,800 --> 00:37:54,120
What are you doing here?

692
00:37:54,360 --> 00:37:56,320
This is my room.

693
00:37:56,400 --> 00:37:58,000
Why can't I be here?

694
00:37:58,320 --> 00:38:01,920
Mom, please go away.

695
00:38:02,160 --> 00:38:03,600
Please leave us alone.

696
00:38:05,600 --> 00:38:08,800
Chi, Father and Chung both died.

697
00:38:09,120 --> 00:38:10,960
Mother is heartbroken.

698
00:38:11,520 --> 00:38:13,360
You want to cheer her up, right?

699
00:38:14,720 --> 00:38:16,240
I have a plan.

700
00:38:17,120 --> 00:38:20,680
But you must get up early
tomorrow morning and pack.

701
00:38:20,920 --> 00:38:22,800
We'll move to a hotel for a month.

702
00:38:23,240 --> 00:38:24,240
Can you do that?

703
00:38:24,560 --> 00:38:28,120
Yes. What's the plan?

704
00:38:28,880 --> 00:38:30,160
I'll tell you later.

705
00:38:31,520 --> 00:38:33,280
As long as I can fool this idiot,

706
00:38:33,520 --> 00:38:38,720
soon, when Chung's trust fund
comes into effect,

707
00:38:39,280 --> 00:38:40,880
it'll be harvest time for me.

708
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:45,920
I'll kick out this lot of idiots

709
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:49,360
and start my second life.

710
00:39:10,040 --> 00:39:10,800
Chi!

711
00:39:11,000 --> 00:39:13,760
Mom, I missed you.

712
00:39:14,120 --> 00:39:15,840
Cousin Han, I thought you're not coming.

713
00:39:16,400 --> 00:39:19,520
If I said I'm coming, I won't see Chi.

714
00:39:23,040 --> 00:39:25,840
When you asked me yesterday
whether I'll attend the funeral,

715
00:39:26,080 --> 00:39:29,120
I knew you'd tip her off.

716
00:39:29,640 --> 00:39:33,360
If I said I'm coming,
someone won't let me see Chi.

717
00:39:33,600 --> 00:39:35,160
Am I right?

718
00:39:36,400 --> 00:39:37,680
You're overthinking.

719
00:39:37,880 --> 00:39:40,000
Madam Han, I didn't betray you.

720
00:39:40,400 --> 00:39:43,840
Mom, what did you say? I don't understand.

721
00:39:44,720 --> 00:39:46,320
There's something I don't understand either.

722
00:39:46,400 --> 00:39:48,320
I want to ask you...come with me.

723
00:39:51,560 --> 00:39:54,000
I have something to ask you,
you better answer me honestly.

724
00:39:54,520 --> 00:39:58,480
Why did you put the jacket and
the watch in my room?

725
00:39:58,560 --> 00:39:59,760
Who told you to do it?

726
00:40:00,960 --> 00:40:06,680
I only put the watch...no jacket.

727
00:40:08,160 --> 00:40:10,760
Not you? Then who was it?

728
00:40:11,160 --> 00:40:18,000
I don't know. You threw it away
then you took it back.

729
00:40:18,080 --> 00:40:20,960
I thought you wanted to keep it.

730
00:40:21,280 --> 00:40:23,920
Who taught you to put the watch in my room?

731
00:40:24,440 --> 00:40:25,440
Your wife?

732
00:40:28,440 --> 00:40:32,240
No, you threw it out.

733
00:40:32,360 --> 00:40:39,040
I thought when you're not angry with Chung B
you might want it back.

734
00:40:39,160 --> 00:40:41,840
So I put it back for you.

735
00:40:42,720 --> 00:40:45,240
That woman brainwashed you.

736
00:40:45,480 --> 00:40:46,680
Where are you staying?

737
00:40:46,880 --> 00:40:48,800
I'll help you pack. Come home with me.

738
00:40:48,920 --> 00:40:51,520
I can't tell you.

739
00:40:51,760 --> 00:40:52,880
Chi...
Why not...

740
00:40:53,120 --> 00:40:54,320
Go back inside.

741
00:40:56,360 --> 00:40:58,720
I want to talk to you.

742
00:41:04,880 --> 00:41:06,160
What is it?

743
00:41:09,720 --> 00:41:12,960
I have always wanted to hit you. Period.

744
00:41:13,760 --> 00:41:15,040
You...

745
00:41:15,200 --> 00:41:16,680
I won't go easy on you...
No, Mother...

746
00:41:16,760 --> 00:41:18,000
I'll kill you...
Don't hit me...

747
00:41:18,080 --> 00:41:20,320
I'll get you for this...
Stop hitting me...

748
00:41:20,400 --> 00:41:21,840
Stop! What's going on?

749
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:24,000
This tramp hit me!

750
00:41:24,080 --> 00:41:26,080
No, Mother was wrong about me...

751
00:41:26,160 --> 00:41:28,480
I wanted to explain and she slapped me.

752
00:41:28,560 --> 00:41:30,800
Then she chased me out
and wanted to hit me again.

753
00:41:30,920 --> 00:41:34,000
You seduced my husband
and want to steal the inheritance.

754
00:41:34,200 --> 00:41:37,680
She told my son to put the watch in my room
to frame me for killing my grandson.

755
00:41:37,760 --> 00:41:39,440
How vicious of you!

756
00:41:39,520 --> 00:41:41,840
No...she made that up!
What?

757
00:41:41,960 --> 00:41:45,240
She hit me in front of the
villagers earlier.

758
00:41:45,320 --> 00:41:47,040
Now she wants to kill me.

759
00:41:47,160 --> 00:41:48,480
Stop framing me!

760
00:41:49,440 --> 00:41:51,120
Calm down!

761
00:41:51,920 --> 00:41:55,280
Chung's head hit the cabinet because of you!

762
00:41:55,360 --> 00:41:57,600
You shoved him into the glass cabinet.

763
00:41:57,680 --> 00:41:58,760
You meant to kill him.

764
00:41:58,840 --> 00:42:00,400
You should be dead of all people!

765
00:42:02,080 --> 00:42:03,200
Enough!

766
00:42:03,960 --> 00:42:06,080
We'll conduct the investigation
to find the killer.

767
00:42:06,160 --> 00:42:08,760
We came here to tell you something.

768
00:42:10,080 --> 00:42:13,040
According to the record of
Cheung Siu-chung's smart watch company,

769
00:42:13,480 --> 00:42:18,400
his heartbeat stopped at 12:05a.m.
on October 16.

770
00:42:19,240 --> 00:42:22,480
He was 21 years old when he died,

771
00:42:22,960 --> 00:42:26,080
which means he was entitled to inherit
Cheung Kin-kwok's estate.

772
00:42:27,200 --> 00:42:29,760
If Chung was entitled to the inheritance,

773
00:42:30,200 --> 00:42:33,000
this tramp will get all the money!
